275 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 150 0 R
/E (Our current team of officers represents a diverse range of majors and academic years, spanning from sophomore engineers to biomedical science seniors. Despite our varied backgrounds, we all share a common goal - to serve our members and promote the core principles of SASE. Several of our officers have been actively involved in SASE for multiple years, assuming different leadership roles throughout the organization. Our advisor, Dr. Pauline Wade, is an associate professor of practice under the computer science and engineering department at Texas A&M. Collectively, we extend a warm welcome to your chapter, anticipating the opportunities and partnerships that lie ahead. We look forward to this journey together and creating meaningful experiences for all involved.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [16]
>>
endobj
