/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 152 0 R
/E (Professional Events: Our mentorship program serves as a cornerstone of our professional development, supporting over 20 students by fostering meaningful one-on-one connections. This initiative provides a structured environment for participants to gain personalized guidance on navigating their academic journeys and professional aspirations. To further bridge the gap between the classroom and the workforce, we facilitate mock interview sessions for 10+ students. These sessions allow our members to sharpen their technical communication and gain confidence in a supportive setting, ensuring they are well-equipped to excel in real-world recruitment and land their dream roles.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
