317 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 152 0 R
/E (Socials: Social events help us build a strong and close relationship among our members and officers of SASE. In addition, it is a great opportunity for mentors and mentees to exchange ideas, goals, and advice for college and career success. We host a variety of events such as team-building exercises, networking socials, and more fun socials such as crafts, karaoke nights, and board-game nights. Additionally, we work with other student organizations to facilitate inter-organizational events such as Trivia Night which is planned by our collegiate committee and have historically brought over 100 participants across campus. )
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [8]
>>
